"notice_body": "ZAMPANO NOW DREAMS ONE STORY: THE FOURTH CRUSADE, FROM VENICE TO CONSTANTINOPLE, AS A SMALL KNIGHT SEES IT. YOUR WALK IN THE GREEN ZONE AND THE NEIGHBORHOOD SCENES YOU PLAYED ARE KEPT, WITH YOUR COINS AND PLAY TIME. THE STORY STARTS AGAIN FROM 1.1, WITH FRESH METERS, BOOK AND COSTUMES.",
